      * SYNTHETIC SAMPLE - written for the Diocle hackathon project.
      * Fictional company. Not derived from any real system.
      * POSTED PAYMENT WITH ITS FEE (22 BYTES, LINE SEQUENTIAL)
       01  POST-REC.
           05  POST-ID                 PIC X(6).
           05  POST-AMOUNT             PIC S9(5)V99
                                       SIGN LEADING SEPARATE.
           05  POST-FEE                PIC S9(5)V99
                                       SIGN LEADING SEPARATE.
